{"id":"b00dea11c83b74c1","group":"14","path":"14/14-ex-etale-map-not-covering.md","title":"Example II.6 An Étale Map That Is Not a Covering","display":"Example II.6 An Étale Map That Is Not a Covering","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-ex-etale-map-not-covering","aliases":["14-ex-etale-map-not-covering"],"display":"Example II.6 An Étale Map That Is Not a Covering","depends_on":["[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]","[[14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves]]"],"source_location":"II.6, printed 88; DjVu 50; explicit witness constructed in note","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-ex-etale-map-not-covering"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-ex-etale-map-not-covering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Example II.6 An Étale Map That Is Not a Covering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" href=\"?note=ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" title=\"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves\">14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.6, printed 88; DjVu 50; explicit witness constructed in note"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\mathbb R\">\\(X=\\mathbb R\\)</span> 通常拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=(0,\\infty)\">\\(E=(0,\\infty)\\)</span> 及子空间拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:E\\hookrightarrow X\">\\(j:E\\hookrightarrow X\\)</span> 为包含映射。使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" href=\"?note=ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" title=\"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves\">14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves</a> 的谓词。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cover}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cover}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" href=\"?note=ead2b5b1b3a20ecd\" title=\"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves\">14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves</a> 中的精确签名。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Etale}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"afeb22707a474889\" href=\"?note=afeb22707a474889\" title=\"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections\">14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</a> 中的精确签名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"j=\\{(x,x):x\\in(0,\\infty)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Etale}(j;E,\\sigma;\\mathbb R,\\tau)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Cover}(j).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[j=\\{(x,x):x\\in(0,\\infty)\\},\\qquad\\mathrm{Etale}(j;E,\\sigma;\\mathbb R,\\tau)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{Cover}(j).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>包含开子空间的映射处处已有同胚图，所以 étale。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 有等覆盖邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的纤维为空，每个映到整个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的切片都不可能存在，指标必须为空，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j^{-1}U\">\\(j^{-1}U\\)</span> 为空。但每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的实开邻域都含正点，矛盾。此反例在 Cover 允许空纤维的较宽约定下仍成立，精确展示局部同胚与覆盖的差别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","status":"resolved","id":"afeb22707a474889","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 $X=\\mathbb R$ 通常拓扑 $\\tau$，$E=(0,\\infty)$ 及子空间拓扑 $\\sigma$；$j:E\\hookrightarrow X$ 为包含映射。使用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 与 [[14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves]] 的谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"取 $X=\\mathbb R$ 通常拓扑 $\\tau$，$E=(0,\\infty)$ 及子空间拓扑 $\\sigma$；$j:E\\hookrig